---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About Jordan Buttarazzi, Broker | The Precon Market"
  description="Jordan Buttarazzi is a Broker with Valery Real Estate Inc., Brokerage (RECO #5009855), focused on Ontario pre-construction buyers."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6 sm:pt-12">
    <p class="section-label">— About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Jordan Buttarazzi</h1>

    <dl class="card tick-corners mt-6 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-3 p-5 text-[15px] sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] sm:p-6">
      <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rule-dark sm:pt-1">Title</dt>
      <dd>Broker</dd>
      <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rule-dark sm:pt-1">Brokerage</dt>
      <dd>Valery Real Estate Inc., Brokerage</dd>
      <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rule-dark sm:pt-1">RECO</dt>
      <dd class="figure">#5009855</dd>
      <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rule-dark sm:pt-1">Phone</dt>
      <dd><a href="tel:+16473711367" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2">(647) 371-1367</a></dd>
    </dl>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <p>
        I work with pre-construction buyers across the GTA. This site exists because the same phone call kept
        happening: someone reaches me a few weeks before closing, having just learned their price was "inclusive of
        HST" and that the rebate they assumed was theirs had been assigned to the builder on page nine.
      </p>
      <p>
        By that point the options are thin. Caught early, most of it is manageable, and some of it is negotiable
        before you sign.
      </p>
      <p>
        The checker on the home page gives you the rules for nothing. What it won't do is read your agreement, get a
        rebate worksheet out of a builder, or sit on your side of the table at the sales office. Those need a person.
      </p>
      <p>
        Book a call if something in your result didn't sit right. If you haven't signed yet, book one before you do.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <a
        href="/book?source=about"
        class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center border border-accent bg-accent px-6 font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent/90"
      >
        Book a call
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-rule pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
      <p>
        This tool provides a general estimate only and is not tax, legal, or accounting advice. Rebate eligibility is
        determined by the Canada Revenue Agency and depends on your specific circumstances, the wording of your
        agreement of purchase and sale, and program deadlines that may change. Amounts shown are maximums for
        illustration. Confirm your eligibility with your own lawyer and accountant before relying on any figure. Not
        intended to solicit buyers or sellers currently under contract with another brokerage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
